{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " a window to close, minimize or go full screen. Keep holding and drag to move it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "窗口，即可关闭、最小化或进入全屏幕。继续按住并拖移可以移动它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " brings up the on-screen keyboard to type on %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会调出屏幕键盘，在 %@ 上打字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " for a trackpad and keys.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "，即可使用触控板和按键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " has actions: close, minimize, full screen, and move left or right. Swipe up or down to hear them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有这些操作：关闭、最小化、全屏幕、左移或右移。向上或向下轻扫即可听到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " has the menu bar of the app you’re using on %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "里是你在 %@ 上正在使用的 App 的菜单栏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " is at the bottom of Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在设置的最下面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " is on: a window you pick streams from a display of its own on %@, so it keeps updating when something covers it": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已开启：你选的窗口会从 %@ 上一个独立的显示器串流，被别的东西挡住时也会继续更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " is there too, to see this again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "也在那里，可以再看一遍这些介绍。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " lists the apps on %@. Choose an open one again for its next window.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 列出 %@ 上的 App。再次选择一个已打开的 App 可以切换到它的下一个窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " lists the apps on %@: tap an open one again for its next window.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 列出 %@ 上的 App：再次轻点一个已打开的 App 可以切换到它的下一个窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " on the trackpad to right-click.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "触控板即可右键点按。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " puts it where %@’s cursor is.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会把文本放到 %@ 的光标处。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " sends it to %@’s clipboard.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会把文本发送到 %@ 的剪贴板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " sets how long you hold a window’s thumbnail before its controls show.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可设置按住窗口缩略图多久后显示它的控制按钮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " silences this %@ alone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "则只对这台 %@ 生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " stay on for the next key or trackpad click: tap cmd, then C, to copy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按下后会保持到下一个键或触控板点按：先轻点 cmd 再轻点 C 即可拷贝。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " stay on for the next key: cmd, then C, copies.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按下后会保持到下一个键：先按 cmd 再按 C 即可拷贝。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " the trackpad, ": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "触控板，"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " then brings up the keyboard bar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "则会调出键盘栏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " then makes its text larger or smaller: swipe up or down on it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以放大或缩小它的文字：在它上面向上或向下轻扫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " then sizes its text.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 可以调整它的文字大小。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " to click.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "即可点按。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " to copy and paste between it and this %@, and to hear its sound here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "，就能在它和这台 %@ 之间拷贝粘贴，并在这里听到它的声音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " to right-click.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "即可右键点按。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " to scroll.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "即可滚动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " to zoom the picture here, up to 5×. Zoomed in, two fingers move it, and one finger still taps, holds and drags on %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以放大这里的画面，最多 5×。放大后用两指移动画面，单指照样可以在 %@ 上轻点、按住和拖移。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " turns a finger’s drag and the on-screen trackpad’s two-finger scroll around.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会让手指拖移和屏幕触控板的双指滚动反向。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " types on %@ by itself, Esc included, and ": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以直接在 %@ 上打字（包括 Esc），而"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " works as a mouse.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 可以当鼠标用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " · ": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " · "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ Mbps": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ Mbps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ and %@ need the USB cable or very fast Wi‑Fi; if the picture lags, step down.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ and %2$@ need the USB cable or very fast Wi‑Fi; if the picture lags, step down."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@和%2$@需要 USB 线或非常快的 Wi‑Fi；如果画面卡顿，请调低一档。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ answered with another key, so this %@ didn’t reconnect. Tap it to connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ answered with another key, so this %2$@ didn’t reconnect. Tap it to connect."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 用另一把密钥应答，所以这台 %2$@ 没有重新连接。轻点它来连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ answered, but Sill isn’t accepting remote connections there. Check that Sill is open and Remote Access is on. If you changed its port, connect at home once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 有应答，但那里的 Sill 不接受远程连接。请确认 Sill 已打开且“远程访问”已开启。如果你改过它的端口，请在家里连接一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ closed the connection. Sill will reconnect when it can.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 关闭了连接。Sill 会在可以时重新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ closed the connection. Tap it to try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 关闭了连接。轻点它重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ didn’t answer at %@. If your home’s internet address changed, connect at home once to update it, or add an address name on the Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ didn’t answer at %2$@. If your home’s internet address changed, connect at home once to update it, or add an address name on the Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 在 %2$@ 没有应答。如果你家的互联网地址变了，请在家里连接一次来更新，或在 Mac 上添加一个地址名称。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ didn’t answer. Check that Sill is open on it, then tap it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 没有应答。请确认它上面已打开 Sill，然后再轻点一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ didn’t answer. It may be asleep, or %@ may be off on the Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ didn’t answer. It may be asleep, or %2$@ may be off on the Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 没有应答。它可能在睡眠，或者 Mac 上的 %2$@ 已关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ didn’t answer. It may be asleep.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 没有应答。它可能在睡眠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ didn’t answer. Open the menu again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 没有应答。请重新打开菜单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ didn’t answer. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 没有应答。请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ didn’t show a code by itself. On the Mac, choose Pair iPhone or iPad… in the Sill menu.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 没有自动显示配对码。请在 Mac 的 Sill 菜单中选择“配对 iPhone 或 iPad…”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ didn’t show a code. On the Mac, choose Pair iPhone or iPad… in the Sill menu, then tap %@ again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ didn’t show a code. On the Mac, choose Pair iPhone or iPad… in the Sill menu, then tap %2$@ again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 没有显示配对码。请在 Mac 的 Sill 菜单中选择“配对 iPhone 或 iPad…”，然后再轻点 %2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ disconnected. It will reconnect when the Mac is back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已断开连接。Mac 回来后会自动重新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ disconnected. Sill will reconnect when it can reach it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已断开连接。Sill 能联系上它时会重新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ has a new key since this %@ paired. Tap it to pair again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ has a new key since this %2$@ paired. Tap it to pair again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 %2$@ 配对之后，%1$@ 换了新的密钥。轻点它重新配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is already serving 8 devices.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已经在为 8 台设备提供服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is locked": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已锁定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is locked. Unlock it to see its windows.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已锁定。解锁后才能看到它的窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is saved. Tap it to connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已存储。轻点它来连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is showing a code now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 现在正在显示配对码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is showing a code. Point this %@ at it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ is showing a code. Point this %2$@ at it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 正在显示配对码。用这台 %2$@ 对准它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ isn’t answering. It may be asleep. Sill keeps trying, or tap it to try now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 没有应答，可能在睡眠。Sill 会继续尝试，你也可以轻点它立即重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ isn’t pairing right now. On your Mac, choose Pair iPhone or iPad… first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 现在没有在配对。请先在你的 Mac 上选择“配对 iPhone 或 iPad…”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ isn’t responding.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 没有响应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ kept its setting": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 保留了它的设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ lets devices connect without pairing. Pair this %@ once to keep connecting if that changes, and to reach %@ away from home while Remote Access is on. %@ shows a code; scan it with this %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ lets devices connect without pairing. Pair this %2$@ once to keep connecting if that changes, and to reach %3$@ away from home while Remote Access is on. %4$@ shows a code; scan it with this %5$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 允许设备不配对就连接。把这台 %2$@ 配对一次，以后即使这一点改变也能继续连接，在“远程访问”开启时还能在不在家时连接 %3$@。%4$@ 会显示配对码，请用这台 %5$@ 扫描。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ looks off on this %@. Turn it on, then tap %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ looks off on this %2$@. Turn it on, then tap %3$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 %2$@ 上的 %1$@ 似乎已关闭。请打开它，然后轻点 %3$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ megabits per second": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ Mbps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ menus": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 菜单"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ no longer accepts this %@. Pair it again from Sill’s Settings on the Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ no longer accepts this %2$@. Pair it again from Sill’s Settings on the Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 不再接受这台 %2$@。请在 Mac 上 Sill 的设置中重新配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ now asks devices to pair. Tap it to pair this %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ now asks devices to pair. Tap it to pair this %2$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 现在要求设备先配对。轻点它来配对这台 %2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ quit Sill. This %@ reconnects when it’s back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ quit Sill. This %2$@ reconnects when it’s back."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 退出了 Sill。它回来后这台 %2$@ 会重新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ removed this %@. Tap it to pair again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ removed this %2$@. Tap it to pair again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 移除了这台 %2$@。轻点它重新配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ removed this %@. To use it again, pair it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ removed this %2$@. To use it again, pair it again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 移除了这台 %2$@。要再次使用，请重新配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ runs an older Sill. Update Sill on the Mac to connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 运行的是旧版 Sill。请在 Mac 上更新 Sill 后再连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ second": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
