    "Held upright, a window’s picture takes the place of the window thumbnails and reaches down to where the keyboard comes up. The Desktop keeps the thumbnails. Switch windows with Apps: tap an open app again for its next window. To fill the taller picture with a window, set its text size with Aa. A change applies when you close Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "竖着拿时，窗口画面会取代窗口缩略图，并一直延伸到键盘弹出的位置。桌面仍保留缩略图。用“App”切换窗口：再次轻点一个已打开的 App 可以切换到它的下一个窗口。要让窗口填满更高的画面，用 Aa 设置它的文字大小。更改会在关闭设置时生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
