            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 %1$@ 最高显示 %2$lld fps。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This code expired. Choose Pair iPhone or iPad… on your Mac for a new one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个配对码已过期。请在你的 Mac 上选择“配对 iPhone 或 iPad…”获取新的配对码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This isn’t the %@ this %@ paired with. If Sill was set up again on it, forget it here and pair again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "This isn’t the %1$@ this %2$@ paired with. If Sill was set up again on it, forget it here and pair again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这不是这台 %2$@ 配对过的那台 %1$@。如果它上面的 Sill 重新设置过，请在这里忘记它，然后重新配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three fingers on the trackpad or over the stream.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在触控板上或串流画面上用三指。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three-Finger Gestures": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "三指手势"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three-finger strokes do nothing while this is off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭时，三指操作不起作用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To find your Mac, allow Local Network for Sill in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要找到你的 Mac，请在“设置”中允许 Sill 使用本地网络。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To reach %@ away from home, turn on Remote Access in Sill’s Settings on the Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要在不在家时连接 %@，请在 Mac 上 Sill 的设置中打开“远程访问”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To reach %@, allow Local Network for Sill in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要连接 %@，请在“设置”中允许 Sill 使用本地网络。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To unlock it from here, type its password and press Return. Its windows come back once it is unlocked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要从这里解锁，请输入它的密码并按 Return。解锁后它的窗口就会回来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too long to send: %@ takes up to %@ of text.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Too long to send: %1$@ takes up to %2$@ of text."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "太长了，无法发送：%1$@ 最多接收 %2$@ 的文本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch and hold": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn your %@ on its side": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把 %@ 横过来"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turning this off disconnects this %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭此项会断开这台 %@ 的连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turns a finger’s drag and the trackpad’s two-finger scroll around.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让手指拖移和触控板的双指滚动反向。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type the address and code from your Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入你 Mac 上的地址和配对码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type the address and code that Sill shows on your Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
