            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在这台 %1$@ 上更新 Sill，才能继续使用 %2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Update Sill on this %@ to keep using %@. It needs version %@ or later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Update Sill on this %1$@ to keep using %2$@. It needs version %3$@ or later."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在这台 %1$@ 上更新 Sill，才能继续使用 %2$@。它需要 %3$@ 或更高版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Upright, Sill adds keys and a trackpad.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "竖着拿时，Sill 会加上按键和触控板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Virtual Display": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "虚拟显示器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VoiceOver keeps three-finger gestures for itself, so the rows above do them on %@ instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "旁白会保留三指手势给自己用，所以上面这几行可以代替在 %@ 上执行这些手势。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for %@…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待 %@…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you do here happens on %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你在这里的操作会发生在 %@ 上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where the cursor is.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "粘贴到光标处。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While a window streams, a gesture shows the Desktop first, and the opposite gesture closes what one opened. %@ does these with its own keyboard shortcuts: one turned off in its Keyboard settings does nothing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "串流窗口时，手势会先显示桌面，反方向的手势会关闭前一个手势打开的内容。%@ 用它自己的键盘快捷键来执行这些操作：在它的键盘设置中关闭的快捷键不会起作用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Windows": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "窗口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Windows and Menus": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "窗口和菜单"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wired": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With ": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Work": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Mac has to be on the same Wi‑Fi network as this %@, or have Direct Wireless Connection turned on in Sill. Away from home, add it once with a code from your Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 Mac 必须和这台 %@ 在同一个 Wi‑Fi 网络中，或者在 Sill 中开启了“无线直连”。不在家时，用你 Mac 上的配对码添加一次即可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your VPN looks off on this %@. Turn it on, then tap %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Your VPN looks off on this %1$@. Turn it on, then tap %2$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 %@ 上的 VPN 似乎已关闭。请打开它，然后轻点 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "by address": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过地址"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cmd, opt, ctrl and shift": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "cmd、opt、ctrl 和 shift"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "its address": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它的地址"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "its name": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它的名字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS asks before Sill reads the clipboard, so what you copy here stays on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 读取剪贴板前 macOS 会先询问，因此你在这里拷贝的内容会留在这台 Mac 上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS doesn’t let Sill read the clipboard, so what you copy here stays on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 不允许 Sill 读取剪贴板，因此你在这里拷贝的内容会留在这台 Mac 上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
